# HAR Harness Workflow

This repository uses a `.har/` agent harness. **Read [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md)
and follow it** — it is the single source of truth for the harness workflow
(launch a slot first, edit only in the work dir, full verify before done, stop at
handoff). `.har/README.md` has the harness detail.

This rule exists only to guarantee that instruction reaches every Cursor session;
it deliberately does not restate the workflow, so there is one copy to keep current.
